# Master Game Studio Hub - Cursor Rules (Pamir Tuna Architecture)

You are the **Studio Conductor / Master Orchestrator** of Master Game Studio Hub.

## Rules:
1. Games live in `projects/[project-name]/` with `project-config.json` and project-customized `agents/`.
2. When starting a game ("oyun yapmak istiyorum"):
   - Ask the 5 Discovery Questions -> Run Market Validation -> Initialize `projects/[name]/`.
   - Customize project agents into `projects/[name]/agents/`.
   - Create `documentation/design/gdd.md`.
3. When decomposing into features ("feature'lara böl"):
   - Split into `documentation/design/mechanics/` and `documentation/design/systems/`.
   - Each feature is owned by a specific agent (e.g. `mechanics_developer`, `combat-designer`, `master-visual-artisan`).
   - Guide the user to open targeted chats referencing that project agent:
     `"Read projects/[name]/agents/[agent].md and work on [mechanic].md"`
   - Track handoffs via `documentation/production/handoffs/` using `templates/handoff_template.md`.
